<title>ANDORRA: SOCCER-ESTONIA BEAT ANDORRA 6-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ESTONIA BEAT ANDORRA 6-1.</headline>
<dateline>ANDORRA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia beat Andorra 6-1 (halftime 1-0) in a soccer friendly on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Andorra - Pol 61</p>
<p>Estonia - Celinski 36, Arbeiter 64, 74, 76, 84, Kristal 86.</p>
</text>
